WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.508
[opening theme music playing]

00:36.578 --> 00:38.955
[ominous music playing]

00:51.009 --> 00:52.719
[Seo Yul] Can a soul shifter
who's run wild

00:52.802 --> 00:55.847
truly turn back into a human being
with treatment?

00:57.182 --> 01:00.185
We are not treating him
to turn him back into a human being.

01:00.685 --> 01:03.271
We're merely trying to return him
to consciousness

01:03.354 --> 01:04.731
long enough to talk to him.

01:08.151 --> 01:10.153
So we're not trying to turn him back then.

01:10.820 --> 01:13.990
Once they have run wild,
soul shifters are not human.

01:14.949 --> 01:16.242
They're monsters.

01:18.244 --> 01:21.039
[Jin] They'll either feed off
the energy of human beings,

01:21.122 --> 01:23.291
or be petrified. It's one or the other.

01:30.548 --> 01:32.300
There's no way to stop them running wild.

01:34.427 --> 01:35.595
[sighs]

01:36.721 --> 01:37.722
The ice stone.

01:39.849 --> 01:42.268
I heard the ice stone
has the power of Hwansu.

01:42.352 --> 01:44.270
Couldn't we stop them with that power?

01:45.980 --> 01:47.982
It's possible. But…

01:49.192 --> 01:53.029
that's a power that should be forbidden
to all mankind.

01:55.073 --> 01:56.574
[thunder rumbles]

01:57.575 --> 01:58.701
[lightning crackles]

02:01.788 --> 02:03.081
[thunder rumbling]

02:06.584 --> 02:08.169
It seems like it's going to rain.

02:10.505 --> 02:13.299
The energy of the Soul Ejector
we didn't get to use

02:13.383 --> 02:16.344
will soon be washed away
in the coming rainstorm.

02:16.427 --> 02:19.389
Can that energy
really just disappear in the rain?

02:19.472 --> 02:22.058
The power of the ice stone
came from the skies.

02:22.142 --> 02:24.727
So that power can be taken away
by the skies as well.

02:27.897 --> 02:29.941
[thunder rumbles]

02:34.988 --> 02:37.282
[loud rumbling]

02:40.910 --> 02:42.871
[wind whooshing]

02:45.915 --> 02:48.877
[Jin Mu] Was that child
trying to summon the power of the skies

02:48.960 --> 02:51.171
to destroy the ice stone?

02:51.254 --> 02:52.213
[sighs]

02:55.925 --> 02:57.093
Jin Bu-yeon.

02:58.803 --> 03:01.806
If she were alive,
she would have become a great priestess

03:02.515 --> 03:05.226
who could even control
the energy of the sky.

03:07.604 --> 03:09.731
[enigmatic music]

03:29.375 --> 03:30.835
You're all right.

03:31.461 --> 03:34.380
Look at me. I'm all right too.
You didn't run wild.

03:37.091 --> 03:38.843
[thunder rumbles]

03:40.178 --> 03:42.180
[epic music]

03:53.149 --> 03:55.026
The ceiling above the basin is open.

03:55.693 --> 03:57.987
- [Jang Uk] Is it not always open?
- [Mu-deok] No.

03:58.529 --> 04:00.031
It might look like it's open,

04:00.990 --> 04:02.784
but he said that it is actually closed.

04:02.867 --> 04:05.119
Who did? Your father?

04:06.871 --> 04:08.456
He said that the ceiling…

04:09.832 --> 04:12.293
could only be opened
by a constellation recorder mage.

04:12.919 --> 04:14.212
So how is it open?

04:14.837 --> 04:18.007
Uh, regardless,
I think we did something wrong here.

04:18.091 --> 04:19.425
[Jang Uk] Uh, what happened?

04:21.427 --> 04:22.512
[Mu-deok] It was me.

04:24.597 --> 04:25.765
I just did it.

04:27.058 --> 04:28.685
My energy seeped into the water.

04:29.686 --> 04:31.479
Like at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

04:32.272 --> 04:33.898
and in the Mirror of Longing.

04:35.775 --> 04:38.027
My energy came back as well.

04:42.282 --> 04:43.825
[thunder rumbles]

04:48.538 --> 04:49.580
[Jang Uk gasps]

04:50.081 --> 04:51.416
[lightning crackles]

04:53.835 --> 04:56.546
[suspenseful music playing]

04:57.130 --> 04:58.464
What do you mean lightning?

04:58.548 --> 05:00.591
There was a loud noise
from the Constellation Basin room.

05:01.384 --> 05:04.470
Jang Uk and Eunuch Kim
are in there now, aren't they?

05:12.478 --> 05:13.688
It's the Soul Ejector.

05:15.481 --> 05:17.942
I've seen that dark energy before
in the alchemy of souls.

05:19.402 --> 05:20.278
[Mu-deok groans]

05:20.361 --> 05:21.612
What is it?

05:22.196 --> 05:24.657
I can't see, it's just like
when I came out of the mirror

05:25.783 --> 05:27.368
I feel dizzy and nauseous.

05:27.452 --> 05:29.537
Jin Mu will be back soon.
We need to get out of here.

05:41.966 --> 05:43.342
Oh, right. The doors.

05:44.385 --> 05:45.303
[sighs]

05:46.095 --> 05:47.513
The doors are sealed with energy,

05:47.597 --> 05:49.891
the basin's damaged,
and the soul shifter is dead.

05:50.892 --> 05:52.393
[sighs]
This is a mess.

05:53.186 --> 05:55.897
There's another exit for servants
right next to the basin.

05:56.689 --> 05:58.858
I remember using it
with my father when I was little.

05:59.442 --> 06:01.444
Even if we use it,
we're still in Cheonbugwan.

06:05.740 --> 06:08.618
[Jang Uk] You cannot see,
and I don't know any way around.

06:09.911 --> 06:13.539
If we get lost,
the mages of Cheonbugwan will catch us.

06:13.623 --> 06:15.708
If we stay here, Jin Mu will kill us.

06:15.792 --> 06:17.335
I'm not strong enough to defeat him.

06:18.753 --> 06:21.130
[tense music playing]

06:21.214 --> 06:23.966
I'm going to call a savior to help us.

06:25.259 --> 06:27.095
- A savior?
- Yes.

06:29.180 --> 06:32.642
With a fluttering heart,
he's going to run here immediately.

06:33.309 --> 06:34.769
This savior of mine.

06:42.151 --> 06:43.194
[Go Won exhales]

06:43.277 --> 06:45.947
[somber music playing]

06:47.990 --> 06:49.700
[yin-yang jade chiming]

06:58.918 --> 07:00.920
Jang Uk, you must be mad.

07:06.843 --> 07:08.553
There was a noise from the main room.

07:08.636 --> 07:11.681
Yes, sir. We didn't go in there
since you told us not to.

07:11.764 --> 07:13.891
Yeom-su, follow me, everyone else,
guard the door.

07:30.199 --> 07:32.452
Jang Uk somehow broke the barrier
and escaped.

07:32.535 --> 07:33.411
[Yeom-su] Sir.

07:34.162 --> 07:35.288
The basin…

07:36.664 --> 07:38.416
How did they damage the basin?

07:39.459 --> 07:41.002
I'll find him.

07:41.085 --> 07:42.962
Jang Uk will not leave here alive.

07:43.588 --> 07:45.339
Make sure you're not seen.

07:45.423 --> 07:47.550
And move the body
to the Secret Room first.

07:47.633 --> 07:48.759
[Yeom-su] Yes, sir.

07:54.640 --> 07:56.809
Seal every exit out of Cheonbugwan.

07:56.893 --> 07:58.686
And find Jang Uk and his maidservant.

07:59.312 --> 08:01.772
If they try to fight back,
you may kill them.

08:01.856 --> 08:02.815
[soldiers] Yes, sir.

08:17.455 --> 08:20.833
Jang Uk will never find his way
out of this labyrinthine place.

08:22.460 --> 08:23.961
He'll get lost and be caught.

08:26.297 --> 08:27.298
Unless…

08:28.257 --> 08:32.303
maybe he knew he would get lost
and decided to hide instead.

08:35.598 --> 08:37.099
You almost fooled me.

08:38.434 --> 08:39.519
[Jin Mu] Are you here?

08:40.853 --> 08:43.523
I noticed you broke
the water barrier I made.

08:43.606 --> 08:45.733
Why don't I make one with fire next time?

08:47.443 --> 08:50.071
If you're completely surrounded
by a fire perhaps,

08:50.154 --> 08:51.489
that will convince…

08:52.240 --> 08:55.284
you to show yourselves.

08:55.368 --> 08:57.328
[Jang Uk]
Convince me like you did earlier,

08:57.411 --> 08:58.913
instead of just threatening.

09:01.582 --> 09:04.210
Why should I do that
when I have nothing to lose?

09:04.293 --> 09:07.964
You're a trespasser
who damaged the precious basin,

09:08.047 --> 09:12.134
and I, as Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,
have a duty to get rid of you.

09:15.680 --> 09:17.890
You're being pretty harsh
to a guest who came with gifts.

09:18.724 --> 09:21.811
Is it because you're angry that we turned
your friend back there into stone?

09:21.894 --> 09:22.979
What friend?

09:23.771 --> 09:28.192
I don't remember seeing anyone here
but you two except myself.

09:29.026 --> 09:31.070
Ah, so you're planning to hide that rock.

09:32.071 --> 09:33.114
[Jang Uk] But how?

09:34.699 --> 09:37.368
- You will be caught.
- [Jin Mu] That won't happen.

09:37.868 --> 09:40.746
Because you and your maid
will soon be dead.

09:41.956 --> 09:42.999
Now show yourself.

09:43.499 --> 09:44.625
Come on out!

09:44.709 --> 09:46.669
[thrilling music playing]

10:10.484 --> 10:11.694
[panting]
Hey.

10:12.194 --> 10:13.738
Did you see it too?

10:13.821 --> 10:16.115
A bolt of lightning just struck
near Cheonbugwan.

10:16.198 --> 10:18.784
Cheonbugwan's right next
to the royal palace.

10:18.868 --> 10:21.537
I should go and see
if everyone's all right.

10:21.621 --> 10:23.456
The bolt was enormous.

10:23.539 --> 10:26.292
I hope Jin Mu got hit by it.
That scoundrel.

10:26.375 --> 10:27.627
[Heo Yeom chuckles]

10:27.710 --> 10:30.254
[foreboding music continues]

10:41.307 --> 10:42.475
It is a pity.

10:43.476 --> 10:46.103
I bet you came in to look around,

10:46.187 --> 10:48.397
dreaming of the day
you would be the Gwanju.

10:48.481 --> 10:50.066
But to die on your first visit…

10:50.149 --> 10:51.901
[Jin Mu] You're an unlucky man.

10:53.486 --> 10:54.403
It's such a shame.

10:55.154 --> 10:56.280
If I were to die,

10:56.364 --> 10:58.616
you would have easily become
the actual Gwanju.

10:58.699 --> 11:00.284
Too bad, you won't be able to kill me.

11:00.368 --> 11:01.369
What?

11:03.954 --> 11:05.623
Have you heard of the yin-yang jade?

11:07.124 --> 11:09.627
A red jade and a blue jade make a pair.

11:09.710 --> 11:12.296
If you fill one with energy,
the other one will react to it.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.714
If they're nearby each other,

11:14.507 --> 11:16.550
the two will be drawn together,
no matter what.

11:17.802 --> 11:18.761
So what?

11:18.844 --> 11:20.304
Of the two pieces,

11:21.180 --> 11:23.140
your pupil, the Crown Prince
has the blue jade.

11:25.226 --> 11:26.352
[Jin Mu] That's a nice jade.

11:26.435 --> 11:28.145
[Go Won] I got it for ten gold toads.

11:29.063 --> 11:30.231
Is it valuable?

11:32.233 --> 11:33.442
So what if he has it?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.320
Well, you see,
I had the matching red jade.

11:36.404 --> 11:38.572
And I filled it with energy,
so the Crown Prince…

11:39.824 --> 11:41.409
is on his way here to find it.

11:44.745 --> 11:45.871
[snickers]

11:49.583 --> 11:50.626
What?

11:51.502 --> 11:53.045
You want to kill me and take it from me?

11:54.463 --> 11:57.174
I thought you would,
so I hid it somewhere else already.

11:59.677 --> 12:02.138
I filled the red jade
with energy and I hid it

12:02.221 --> 12:04.181
in the robe of the eunuch
who was petrified.

12:04.265 --> 12:06.392
[thrilling music playing]

12:13.899 --> 12:17.236
[Jang Uk] The Crown Prince is probably
heading for that hunk of rock right now.

12:21.240 --> 12:23.576
Imagine how he would react
when he sees it though.

12:24.201 --> 12:26.829
Oh… I think he'll be quite shocked.

12:39.300 --> 12:40.301
[Go Won] Cheonbugwan.

12:42.845 --> 12:44.889
Jang Uk is somewhere inside.

12:52.521 --> 12:54.023
Rather than killing me,

12:54.857 --> 12:56.901
perhaps you should go stop
Crown Prince first.

12:59.153 --> 13:00.905
[Jin Mu snickers]

13:01.572 --> 13:03.240
Until I take care of this matter,

13:04.408 --> 13:06.702
you will not be able
to leave this place anyway.

13:18.464 --> 13:20.466
- Where is he?
- Inside the Secret Room.

13:20.549 --> 13:22.426
[Yeom-su] On your order,
I'll take him outside.

13:32.853 --> 13:33.687
Where…

13:37.107 --> 13:40.861
Not here. That bastard fooled me again.

13:40.945 --> 13:42.238
[Jin Mu growls]

13:43.572 --> 13:45.032
Excuse me, sir.

13:45.115 --> 13:47.910
We tried not to let anyone in,
but we had no choice.

13:47.993 --> 13:51.163
Is the Crown Prince here by chance?

13:51.247 --> 13:52.206
Yes.

13:54.333 --> 13:56.502
So he wasn't lying about the jade.

14:13.185 --> 14:14.228
So tell me.

14:14.311 --> 14:17.398
Is it really true a eunuch serving
the royal family was a soul shifter?

14:20.568 --> 14:23.195
And you tried to kill Uk
to keep that a secret.

14:23.279 --> 14:25.322
It's just a misunderstanding, sire.

14:29.910 --> 14:32.079
[suspenseful music playing]

14:37.585 --> 14:39.253
[loud rumbling]

15:02.318 --> 15:03.527
You even tried to

15:03.611 --> 15:06.238
use my maid as prey for that soul shifter.

15:06.322 --> 15:10.242
You better have a good excuse
if you wanna call this a misunderstanding.

15:22.504 --> 15:25.507
Are you asking about Cho Chung,
the man who used to work

15:25.591 --> 15:27.718
as a constellation recorder mage
at Cheonbugwan?

15:27.801 --> 15:32.056
I heard Jang Gang of this house
and Cho Chung were very close.

15:32.139 --> 15:33.182
That's true.

15:33.933 --> 15:35.601
They've always been very good friends.

15:36.268 --> 15:37.937
[maid Kim] He visited our home often.

15:38.520 --> 15:42.066
He made funny jokes,
and he was a warm-hearted man.

15:43.192 --> 15:47.571
Cho Chung got involved in sorcery,
and it wiped out his entire family.

15:47.655 --> 15:49.239
He was such a good man.

15:49.949 --> 15:53.410
It's still so hard to believe
that such a thing happened.

15:54.828 --> 15:58.666
I understand he had a daughter as well.
Did you know her?

15:59.541 --> 16:01.001
Yes, I remember.

16:01.502 --> 16:05.255
She was always by her father's side.
They were very close too.

16:05.339 --> 16:07.383
I heard she also disappeared in the chaos.

16:08.258 --> 16:09.176
I'm sure…

16:10.094 --> 16:11.470
she didn't survive.

16:12.471 --> 16:14.765
What makes you so sure that she's dead?

16:14.848 --> 16:18.769
Master Jang Gang tried to find her
for a very long time.

16:19.770 --> 16:22.982
Unless someone was purposely
hiding that young child,

16:23.065 --> 16:25.025
why else wouldn't he have found that girl?

16:26.276 --> 16:27.569
Madam Do-hwa died.

16:28.612 --> 16:30.698
And his best friend was destroyed.

16:30.781 --> 16:34.451
Master Jang was not
in his right mind back then.

16:34.535 --> 16:37.913
As if he blamed himself
for both of their deaths.

16:38.580 --> 16:40.165
He was in such great agony.

16:41.375 --> 16:43.836
He left home
to find his friend's daughter,

16:43.919 --> 16:46.130
so I thought he would come back
after he found her.

16:46.672 --> 16:47.673
But…

16:48.382 --> 16:52.261
would he really be gone for over 20 years
just trying to find a little girl?

16:53.053 --> 16:55.723
I'm starting to worry
that maybe he hasn't come back

16:55.806 --> 16:57.266
for another reason, you see.

16:57.766 --> 17:02.187
If he had found the child 20 years ago
when he started looking,

17:02.271 --> 17:04.898
she would not have had quite
such a difficult life.

17:04.982 --> 17:07.735
And Jang Gang would not have had
to feel so guilty

17:07.818 --> 17:08.944
after all those years either.

17:09.028 --> 17:10.029
Why guilty?

17:10.654 --> 17:12.698
Are you suggesting that Master Jang Gang

17:12.781 --> 17:14.616
wronged his best friend Cho Chung
in some way?

17:15.242 --> 17:17.327
Punishing someone who practiced sorcery

17:17.411 --> 17:19.371
would be the right thing to do
for any mage in this case.

17:19.455 --> 17:21.498
No matter how close they may have been,

17:21.582 --> 17:23.542
it was not wrong of Master Jang
to do that.

17:23.625 --> 17:25.127
You can't just do what's right

17:25.210 --> 17:27.880
or what's wrong based merely
on the things that you can see.

17:28.464 --> 17:30.966
There's a hidden reason
and a forgotten story,

17:31.050 --> 17:34.261
and they get tangled together
to form the ties that bind us.

17:34.344 --> 17:35.929
Are you implying

17:36.013 --> 17:38.390
that the Cho family
is still holding a grudge

17:39.183 --> 17:41.226
against the Jang family
for what happened to them?

17:42.895 --> 17:43.896
Is there…

17:44.938 --> 17:48.901
someone from the Cho family
who holds a grudge against this household?

17:49.902 --> 17:52.196
Has Songrim finally found that girl
after all these years?

17:54.740 --> 17:55.908
That little girl…

17:58.368 --> 17:59.536
is dead.

18:02.790 --> 18:03.749
Ah.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.085
I understand.

18:06.919 --> 18:08.087
That poor thing.

18:09.296 --> 18:11.256
I should hold a memorial service.

18:14.593 --> 18:15.719
Maidservant Kim.

18:16.887 --> 18:20.474
- You're very warm-hearted.
- It's not a gesture of kindness.

18:20.557 --> 18:23.727
I'm worried that her spirit will stay here
to hurt Young Master Jang.

18:24.269 --> 18:25.729
That's the only reason.

18:25.813 --> 18:28.107
What if her soul really is here?

18:28.190 --> 18:30.109
What if it's lingering
near the young master?

18:30.192 --> 18:32.027
I'll get rid of it, of course.

18:32.111 --> 18:35.572
How could I let it linger
if it's obviously an evil spirit?

18:37.199 --> 18:38.742
Evil spirit.

18:40.994 --> 18:42.162
[inhales deeply]

18:42.996 --> 18:44.540
Do you know where Mu-deok is now?

18:44.623 --> 18:45.833
Mu-deok?

18:46.416 --> 18:49.503
I sent her to Cheonbugwan
to run an errand.

18:56.635 --> 18:58.053
You're all right? Are you able to see?

18:58.804 --> 19:00.639
Yes, I can see fine now.

19:01.223 --> 19:02.307
[Mu-deok] And you?

19:02.391 --> 19:04.643
Are you injured, young master?

19:04.726 --> 19:05.853
[Jang Uk] I'm all right.

19:05.936 --> 19:08.313
What does it mean when two people
share a pair of tokens?

19:08.397 --> 19:10.607
That they're married or lovers.

19:14.027 --> 19:17.197
Your Royal Highness, Songrim's leader
is here just as you ordered.

19:17.281 --> 19:20.117
[thrilling music playing]

19:37.843 --> 19:39.511
You came to Cheonbugwan

19:40.262 --> 19:42.931
to give the Assistant Gwanju
honey biscuits?

19:43.015 --> 19:46.852
Yes, I heard you two argued over that.

19:47.519 --> 19:49.771
[Jang Uk] Maidservant Kim said
he'll hold a grudge over a food,

19:49.855 --> 19:51.857
so I brought him a gift
she sent out of concern.

19:51.940 --> 19:53.358
What a feeble excuse that is.

19:54.401 --> 19:55.569
The leader of Songrim

19:55.652 --> 19:58.655
and Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan
fighting over honey biscuits?

20:00.240 --> 20:01.283
Even if that were true,

20:01.366 --> 20:03.952
why would you be in the main room
by the constellation basin

20:04.036 --> 20:04.995
instead of just leaving?

20:05.078 --> 20:07.414
I wanted to see the constellation basin
of Cheonbugwan.

20:07.497 --> 20:10.292
However, I ended up seeing something
I shouldn't have.

20:10.375 --> 20:11.627
[ominous music playing]

20:11.710 --> 20:14.588
Are you certain
that you saw a soul shifter?

20:15.214 --> 20:18.675
Yes. And he trapped me inside the barrier
to cover it up

20:18.759 --> 20:20.719
and left Mu-deok
to be the soul shifter's prey.

20:21.428 --> 20:22.804
These lies are unfounded.

20:24.056 --> 20:27.517
Jang Uk entered the main room
of Cheonbugwan without permission

20:27.601 --> 20:29.519
and he damaged the constellation basin.

20:29.603 --> 20:31.939
Now that he finds himself in trouble,

20:32.022 --> 20:34.942
he's making up this ridiculous excuse
about seeing a soul shifter.

20:36.818 --> 20:38.528
I'm sure I saw a soul shifter.

20:38.612 --> 20:40.572
My servant Mu-deok and I both saw it.

20:40.656 --> 20:42.199
He ran wild and completely petrified.

20:42.866 --> 20:44.952
When I came,
there was no soul shifter corpse.

20:45.035 --> 20:46.620
He must have hid it in Cheonbugwan.

20:46.703 --> 20:48.455
You must block all the exits so that

20:48.538 --> 20:51.375
we can find the the soul shifter's body
before he removes it.

20:54.378 --> 20:58.590
I suppose the truth will become clear
if we find the soul shifter's corpse.

21:01.510 --> 21:04.429
I'll summon Songrim's mages
to investigate Cheonbugwan.

21:04.513 --> 21:07.349
No. I cannot let him
just search Cheongbugwan

21:08.016 --> 21:10.394
based solely on Jang Uk's ridiculous lie.

21:10.477 --> 21:12.771
[suspenseful music playing]

21:15.691 --> 21:16.733
Jang Uk.

21:18.485 --> 21:20.529
The soul shifter
was a royal palace eunuch?

21:20.612 --> 21:21.488
[Jang Uk] Yes, sire.

21:21.571 --> 21:25.200
The eunuch I saw beside the Queen
on that day we dueled at Songrim.

21:25.284 --> 21:27.828
Eunuch Oh,
which eunuch was there that day?

21:27.911 --> 21:30.497
Eunuch Kim, Your Highness.
He serves the Queen.

21:31.790 --> 21:34.835
First, we should check
whether he's still in the royal palace.

21:35.419 --> 21:37.045
[Go Won] Go find out, Eunuch Oh.

21:37.129 --> 21:39.172
That won't be necessary.

21:42.884 --> 21:45.345
[tense music playing]

22:02.070 --> 22:03.613
[woman] The Queen has arrived.

22:03.697 --> 22:05.240
Bow before her!

22:12.914 --> 22:13.874
Hello, Mother.

22:15.334 --> 22:17.627
The Assistant Gwanju sent me a message.

22:17.711 --> 22:19.629
I was so shocked, I had to come here.

22:23.258 --> 22:24.092
Is it true?

22:24.593 --> 22:26.386
Was a soul shifter found here?

22:26.887 --> 22:28.347
[Go Won]
They claim the eunuch who served you

22:28.430 --> 22:29.264
was a soul shifter.

22:29.348 --> 22:31.933
And he ran wild
and petrified here at Cheonbugwan.

22:32.017 --> 22:32.934
[queen gasps]

22:33.727 --> 22:36.021
- Really?
- It's not true.

22:36.104 --> 22:38.982
There's never been a soul shifter
who's run wild here.

22:39.066 --> 22:40.275
It's just an absurd lie…

22:41.568 --> 22:44.196
- that Jang Uk is inventing again.
- [Jin] It will become clear

22:44.946 --> 22:47.949
whether or not it's a lie
when the eunuch is found.

22:50.786 --> 22:54.623
Who is this eunuch?
The soul shifter he claims to have seen?

22:55.707 --> 22:57.000
It's Eunuch Kim.

23:03.090 --> 23:04.382
[chuckles]

23:04.466 --> 23:08.386
That's interesting
because Eunuch Kim came here with me.

23:08.470 --> 23:10.472
[tense music continues playing]

23:18.730 --> 23:20.524
Eunuch Kim, please come inside.

23:51.680 --> 23:53.348
Is he the eunuch…

23:54.307 --> 23:56.226
that you claim to have seen here

23:56.810 --> 23:58.061
running wild?

24:00.230 --> 24:01.273
Yeah.

24:01.356 --> 24:03.984
[Go Won] Didn't you say you were sure
that he had petrified?

24:04.067 --> 24:06.403
You would accuse this man
when he's alive and well?

24:07.821 --> 24:08.780
[Jang Uk] You're right.

24:13.076 --> 24:14.452
He looks alive and well.

24:23.295 --> 24:25.463
[queen] The only way to get out of this…

24:28.466 --> 24:31.386
is if we bring this filthy thing
back to life.

24:31.970 --> 24:34.598
[thrilling music playing]

24:47.360 --> 24:48.778
[Jang Uk] The soul shifter is fine now.

24:49.905 --> 24:51.948
If that's the power of the ice stone,

24:52.032 --> 24:54.034
then I can save Mu-deok if she runs wild.

24:55.410 --> 24:56.411
Mu-deok.

24:57.704 --> 24:59.581
We must have been mistaken.

25:01.416 --> 25:02.792
Ah, I guess so, young master.

25:05.045 --> 25:07.631
You weren't mistaken. You blatantly lied.

25:07.714 --> 25:09.799
He's standing there just fine,

25:10.675 --> 25:12.844
so I guess everything I said
was a lie then.

25:17.307 --> 25:19.267
He broke the constellation basin
and panicked

25:19.351 --> 25:22.562
and then, he tried to weasel his way
out of it with these preposterous lies.

25:22.646 --> 25:23.813
Jang Uk.

25:25.232 --> 25:26.983
Is the Assistant Gwanju correct?

25:28.610 --> 25:32.239
Yes, he is right.
Everything I said was a lie.

25:35.367 --> 25:38.286
You entered Cheonbugwan without permission
and broke something valuable.

25:38.370 --> 25:41.623
And then you tried to get out of it
by feeding us some ridiculous lie?

25:42.290 --> 25:44.834
I'm sorry. I apologize.

25:47.712 --> 25:49.464
Since he is a Songrim mage,

25:49.547 --> 25:52.259
allow me to apologize on his behalf
as Songrim's leader.

25:54.094 --> 25:57.013
I also apologize to you, Assistant Gwanju.

26:01.184 --> 26:04.354
Songrim will repair
the constellation basin

26:04.437 --> 26:05.689
that Jang Uk broke.

26:08.191 --> 26:09.401
That's unnecessary.

26:09.484 --> 26:10.694
[Jin] Not at all.

26:10.777 --> 26:13.238
It's only right.
We'll take responsibility.

26:14.948 --> 26:16.408
- I don't--
- Your Majesty.

26:16.491 --> 26:19.661
Please give Songrim a chance
to make up for this.

26:21.955 --> 26:23.498
You should let them do it, dear Mother.

26:25.542 --> 26:27.419
Do as you wish, my dear.

26:28.545 --> 26:30.630
I shall return back to the palace.

26:48.315 --> 26:49.316
[exhales deeply]

26:53.445 --> 26:56.406
I will send our people to Cheonbugwan
first thing tomorrow

26:56.489 --> 26:58.366
and I will personally oversee the repairs.

26:59.117 --> 27:02.412
As for now, I'll go back to Songrim
to punish our mage

27:02.495 --> 27:05.707
for deceiving the royal family
and the people of Cheonbugwan.

27:06.750 --> 27:08.209
- Let's go.
- Absolutely not.

27:08.918 --> 27:12.213
Jang Uk must remain at Cheonbugwan
and receive punishment here.

27:16.468 --> 27:17.385
[Go Won clears throat]

27:17.469 --> 27:22.182
- Well, I also think that's--
- Oh, gosh, no, Your Highness.

27:22.891 --> 27:24.601
Would you please save my young master?

27:25.185 --> 27:27.395
Please, please,
don't let them take him back to Songrim.

27:29.773 --> 27:31.066
[Mu-deok] If he gets dragged off,

27:31.149 --> 27:33.818
I'm afraid that they might even
flog him to death this time.

27:36.196 --> 27:37.697
He once got

27:37.781 --> 27:39.908
flogged 100 times at Songrim.

27:39.991 --> 27:42.118
- [Jang Uk sniffles]
- [Mu-deok] This time will be worse.

27:42.786 --> 27:44.913
Please don't let that happen. Please?

27:46.915 --> 27:48.124
Mu-deok, that's enough.

27:50.126 --> 27:53.254
What I did was wrong.
I should be punished.

27:56.883 --> 27:59.511
I also disrespected His Highness.
[groans softly]

28:01.638 --> 28:03.431
I have no right to ask for mercy.

28:03.515 --> 28:07.560
Are you saying you're going to go
willingly to your death, young master?

28:08.061 --> 28:10.271
If the leader thinks I should die
what choice do I have?

28:13.149 --> 28:13.983
[cries]

28:16.152 --> 28:17.737
[sobs]

28:17.821 --> 28:19.072
[Jang Uk sniffles]

28:19.948 --> 28:21.449
You can take me.

28:23.326 --> 28:25.578
[Mu-deok] Goodness, young master!

28:25.662 --> 28:27.831
But you'll die, young master!

28:27.914 --> 28:31.668
Oh, no, he's going to die! Oh, no!

28:34.587 --> 28:39.050
I will make sure to punish him properly.
All right? Yes.

28:43.263 --> 28:44.889
Wait. Hey.

28:49.477 --> 28:51.521
Jang Uk will be severely punished.

28:51.604 --> 28:53.064
So don't worry about this.

28:54.274 --> 28:55.817
[Go Won] How ridiculous.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.943
But…

28:57.485 --> 29:00.155
I guess the honey biscuit story
was absurd to begin with.

29:00.697 --> 29:03.324
The leader of Songrim
and Assistant Gwanju of Cheonbugwan

29:03.408 --> 29:04.868
fighting over some honey biscuits?

29:05.994 --> 29:06.995
[scoffs]
I mean…

29:07.746 --> 29:09.164
what an outrageous excuse.

29:10.999 --> 29:11.833
Right.

29:14.252 --> 29:16.796
But how did the constellation basin break?

29:18.214 --> 29:19.174
[Go Won inhales]

29:19.257 --> 29:20.633
If it was struck by lightning,

29:21.176 --> 29:23.636
that means the ceiling above it was open.

29:23.720 --> 29:26.931
But I thought only those
who had reached Chisu could do that.

29:27.932 --> 29:29.184
That is correct.

29:32.270 --> 29:34.481
Jang Uk couldn't possibly
have reached Chisu.

29:38.985 --> 29:41.029
So then how could something like this
have happened?

29:46.993 --> 29:48.286
[Jin Mu] Was there another mage,

29:48.369 --> 29:51.164
someone other than Jang Uk
who had reached Chisu?

29:51.706 --> 29:53.374
But that would be impossible.

29:54.793 --> 29:57.003
[ominous music playing]

30:09.891 --> 30:13.144
[Sang-ho] We got out of there,
well, thanks to you, Mu-deok.

30:13.228 --> 30:17.273
People let go if you say to hold on
and they hold on if you say to let go.

30:17.357 --> 30:21.152
So you made a fuss on purpose?
That's clever.

30:21.236 --> 30:24.155
I didn't think that they were really
going to be convinced by you alone,

30:24.239 --> 30:25.990
so I got involved without permission.

30:26.533 --> 30:28.409
I'm very sorry for surprising you.

30:29.410 --> 30:32.497
I had no idea,
so it is true that I was surprised.

30:34.624 --> 30:35.667
But you did well.

30:37.335 --> 30:38.545
[Jang Uk] My Lord.

30:38.628 --> 30:40.588
We weren't lying about any of it.

30:40.672 --> 30:44.342
We clearly saw that Eunuch Kim
ran wild and petrified.

30:44.425 --> 30:45.718
I knew you weren't lying.

30:46.344 --> 30:48.304
I may be slow to pick up on hints,

30:48.805 --> 30:50.682
but I can tell the difference
between a lie and the truth.

30:51.808 --> 30:54.894
A petrified soul shifter
was brought back to life.

30:54.978 --> 30:57.105
Does that mean
that they have the ice stone?

30:57.897 --> 30:59.357
Songrim has been…

31:00.525 --> 31:03.278
keeping an eye on Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan
for a while.

31:03.945 --> 31:05.446
As we suspected…

31:07.740 --> 31:09.701
it appears they do have the ice stone.

31:09.784 --> 31:11.786
[foreboding music playing]

31:15.707 --> 31:19.586
So you put the ice stone in my body, yes?

31:19.669 --> 31:22.005
Its power is truly astounding.

31:23.006 --> 31:25.717
It really feels like I am still alive.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.843
[laughs]

31:26.926 --> 31:30.054
Was Jang Uk the one
who made you petrified?

31:31.055 --> 31:34.183
Just as I was about to suck out
his servant's energy,

31:34.767 --> 31:39.022
suddenly, the energy in my body
was drained.

31:39.606 --> 31:40.982
I lost consciousness.

31:42.150 --> 31:45.653
You didn't see Jang Uk open the ceiling
above the basin either?

31:46.362 --> 31:47.572
No, I did not.

31:47.655 --> 31:48.740
[Jin Mu gasps]

31:48.823 --> 31:51.367
Was there another mage there
other than Jang Uk?

31:52.327 --> 31:53.578
There wasn't.

31:54.746 --> 31:56.915
What if Jang Uk's already reached Chisu

31:57.665 --> 31:58.958
and is merely hiding it?

32:00.668 --> 32:04.297
When he tried to attack me just now,
he didn't seem to be that skilled.

32:04.380 --> 32:07.508
But he mastered Ryusu
in an extremely short time.

32:08.343 --> 32:09.719
So it's possible.

32:09.802 --> 32:11.971
[eunuch Kim laughing]

32:12.639 --> 32:14.682
[eunuch Kim]
Now that I have the ice stone,

32:14.766 --> 32:18.019
does that mean I have reached Hwansu now?

32:18.102 --> 32:19.354
[scoffs]

32:21.230 --> 32:24.525
- The power of Hwansu is in your body.
- [laughs]

32:24.609 --> 32:28.112
But you don't know anything
about casting spells, so…

32:28.696 --> 32:30.323
you are unable to use it.

32:32.575 --> 32:33.534
[scoffs]

32:36.371 --> 32:38.915
But the ice stone is inside of me.

32:38.998 --> 32:41.876
I brought you back to life temporarily
because we had to.

32:56.849 --> 32:58.142
[groaning]

32:59.143 --> 33:01.145
[eunuch Kim groaning]

33:14.409 --> 33:16.202
[grunting]

33:33.136 --> 33:34.220
[chuckles softly]

33:35.763 --> 33:36.806
So the ice stone…

33:37.849 --> 33:40.351
really can keep
a soul shifter from running wild.

33:41.310 --> 33:42.854
We must find it and destroy it.

33:43.646 --> 33:47.275
Bringing soul shifters back to life
when they must be killed instead.

33:47.358 --> 33:49.193
Its power is truly evil.

33:50.862 --> 33:51.904
But that is not…

33:53.740 --> 33:57.243
[Jin] Uk, people will know
you're being punished,

33:57.326 --> 33:59.787
so you shouldn't be at Songrim right now.

33:59.871 --> 34:01.247
Stay at home for a while.

34:01.330 --> 34:05.168
Yes. All right.
Mu-deok and I will head back home, sir.

34:05.251 --> 34:07.670
Try not to cross paths with Jin Mu…

34:08.546 --> 34:09.589
if you can.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.841
Yes.

34:13.885 --> 34:14.802
Let's go.

34:23.269 --> 34:25.396
He'll destroy the ice stone
as soon as he finds it.

34:25.480 --> 34:27.398
So we need to find it before he does.

34:27.482 --> 34:28.983
What Gil-ju said was right.

34:29.776 --> 34:32.487
The ice stone is inside the palace.

34:33.029 --> 34:36.199
That means that the person
must be the Danju

34:37.158 --> 34:38.451
with the ice stone.

34:42.747 --> 34:45.124
[queen]
Be sure to take care of things here.

34:45.208 --> 34:47.794
I'll have Court Lady Han by my side,

34:47.877 --> 34:50.088
so relay your messages through her.

34:50.755 --> 34:51.923
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:52.632 --> 34:57.095
[queen] After what happened today,
Songrim will begin to suspect me.

34:57.178 --> 35:02.016
This happened
because you underestimated Jang Uk.

35:02.600 --> 35:05.436
I had no idea he'd break
through my barrier so easily.

35:05.520 --> 35:07.772
He's a genius who reached Ryusu
in an instant.

35:07.855 --> 35:10.024
And was born with the energy
of the King's Star.

35:10.108 --> 35:11.734
I didn't underestimate him at first.

35:12.693 --> 35:14.320
I also thought he might be special

35:14.403 --> 35:17.198
because of his birth
so I kept my eye on him.

35:17.281 --> 35:20.535
But Jang Uk turned out to be
a complete disappointment.

35:20.618 --> 35:23.371
An average boy. Nothing special at all.

35:26.582 --> 35:29.961
He was just a young master
who was full of himself,

35:30.044 --> 35:32.338
angry at the world
and hiding his helplessness

35:32.839 --> 35:34.298
by acting like he didn't care.

35:34.882 --> 35:37.343
Never having the determination
to do anything,

35:37.426 --> 35:40.263
so all you had to do was pacify him.

35:41.139 --> 35:43.641
So what you're saying
is that he's changed.

35:44.225 --> 35:45.852
I thought he was weak.

35:45.935 --> 35:48.729
But he consumed poison
to open his gate of energy.

35:48.813 --> 35:52.650
I thought he was full of himself
but he won against the Crown Prince.

35:53.192 --> 35:55.278
What could have caused him
to change like that?

35:55.862 --> 35:57.488
People can only change…

35:58.698 --> 36:00.074
for other people.

36:01.450 --> 36:04.203
Find the person who appeared
just when he began changing.

36:07.248 --> 36:08.666
That's your answer.

36:12.295 --> 36:16.048
Jang Uk was rejected by 12 masters,
but now, he's found his way.

36:19.468 --> 36:21.137
Who could have helped him do that?

36:24.891 --> 36:27.518
Master, why don't we go straight
to Danhyanggok?

36:28.811 --> 36:31.439
Since I have to lie low for a while,
we have some time to go there.

36:32.023 --> 36:33.774
Let's go train at Danhyanggok.

36:33.858 --> 36:36.736
We can see how far up that tree
I can climb now.

36:40.781 --> 36:42.742
[Mu-deok] It's freezing now
at Danhyanggok.

36:43.659 --> 36:46.579
If it snows too much
and we get stuck there by any chance,

36:47.121 --> 36:48.581
we could even starve to death.

36:48.664 --> 36:51.667
I thought you said it was always warm
and there was plenty of food.

36:51.751 --> 36:54.086
Didn't you say all that to Yul
when we were back there?

36:58.007 --> 37:01.344
I… just said those things
to put him at ease.

37:02.678 --> 37:05.056
[pensive music playing]

37:05.848 --> 37:09.060
He was worried that his bird
might have struggled during the winter,

37:09.143 --> 37:10.728
so I told him those things.

37:11.562 --> 37:15.942
You mean the bird that he always called
with his whistle at Danhyanggok?

37:19.654 --> 37:20.988
[sighs]

37:35.336 --> 37:36.420
[exhales softly]

37:37.797 --> 37:41.008
Jang Uk could've almost died
at Jin Mu's hand.

37:42.385 --> 37:46.389
For now, I apologized for Uk
and got him out of there.

37:46.472 --> 37:49.225
But there's a chance that Jin Mu
might try to hurt him again.

37:52.353 --> 37:55.606
Fortunately,
I insisted on fixing the basin,

37:55.690 --> 37:57.400
so we have an excuse to get back inside.

37:59.819 --> 38:03.155
I want you two inside Cheonbugwan
with the laborers

38:03.739 --> 38:05.366
and make sure to keep an eye on Jin Mu.

38:06.742 --> 38:07.785
[both] Yes.

38:17.420 --> 38:18.671
Hey, Sang-ho.

38:19.588 --> 38:22.341
I heard that Mu-deok was also there today.

38:22.425 --> 38:24.093
Do you know if she's all right?

38:24.176 --> 38:25.469
Yes. She's fine.

38:26.679 --> 38:27.763
[sighs softly]

38:28.973 --> 38:32.643
Also, was the soul shifter who ran wild

38:32.727 --> 38:34.562
and got petrified really alive?

38:34.645 --> 38:38.107
Yes. That's why the leader had to leave
without saying anything.

38:40.609 --> 38:42.403
Then how did Uk react to that?

38:42.987 --> 38:44.822
He actually didn't seem too flustered.

38:45.406 --> 38:48.200
He just kept asking the leader
if it really was the ice stone

38:48.284 --> 38:50.911
that brought back the soul shifter
who ran wild.

38:50.995 --> 38:53.039
He seemed to know
about the ice stone already.

38:55.541 --> 38:58.544
So he saw a soul shifter
who'd ran wild come back to life.

38:58.627 --> 39:01.088
The leader said
they'd be destroyed, naturally.

39:02.256 --> 39:04.258
Both the soul shifters and the ice stone.

39:04.342 --> 39:06.510
He said we must get rid
of all evil things.

39:06.594 --> 39:08.596
[pensive music playing]

39:09.430 --> 39:11.807
And what did Uk have to say about that?

39:11.891 --> 39:13.809
This is just my hunch,

39:14.769 --> 39:16.312
but he seemed to disagree with it.

39:17.146 --> 39:20.399
Uk has always been carefree and stubborn.

39:21.275 --> 39:24.445
However, he must let go
of his dangerous attitude toward sorcery.

39:25.529 --> 39:27.490
You and Uk are close to each other,

39:27.573 --> 39:29.575
so talk to him
and be sure to warn him about it.

39:36.665 --> 39:37.708
[sighs]

39:41.962 --> 39:44.256
Not only is Danhyanggok cold,

39:44.340 --> 39:46.801
but it would mean that
we would be by ourselves.

39:47.551 --> 39:49.887
And it's the best if we weren't
alone together from now on.

39:50.721 --> 39:52.223
Why not though? All of a sudden?

39:54.975 --> 39:55.893
I…

39:58.771 --> 40:00.314
might devour your energy.

40:00.898 --> 40:04.151
But you didn't run wild. Nothing happened
even after I touched you, right?

40:04.235 --> 40:06.570
But I clearly absorbed the energy
of that eunuch.

40:07.154 --> 40:08.572
I may seem fine now,

40:08.656 --> 40:11.117
but we never know
when that might happen again.

40:11.700 --> 40:12.868
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

40:12.952 --> 40:14.412
You could just run away,

40:15.204 --> 40:16.956
or even kill me if it comes to it.

40:19.375 --> 40:21.085
But if I'm the one who kills you…

40:23.546 --> 40:25.047
it will be unbearable.

40:31.137 --> 40:32.012
[soft chuckle]

40:34.098 --> 40:35.307
Why are you laughing?

40:35.975 --> 40:37.476
Is something funny to you?

40:38.269 --> 40:39.353
It's just…

40:42.565 --> 40:43.732
my heart raced.

40:46.360 --> 40:47.903
You trying to save me…

40:49.196 --> 40:51.574
meant more than what you said
when you missed me.

40:54.618 --> 40:56.996
I guess the assassin finally replied…

40:58.330 --> 41:00.958
to the naive young master's
confession of love.

41:02.543 --> 41:05.629
["Breath" continues playing]

41:10.259 --> 41:12.052
I'm going to find the ice stone

41:12.761 --> 41:16.015
so you'll never need… my energy.

41:23.063 --> 41:25.191
Then, you'll have to go against Park Jin.

41:25.274 --> 41:28.110
Then I'll become as strong as he is.

41:30.905 --> 41:31.906
[soft chuckle]

41:32.490 --> 41:35.493
You just lost nine duels in a row
and even now, you're still so…

41:36.785 --> 41:37.870
full of it.

41:41.415 --> 41:44.960
Oh, the yin-yang jade.
I'll get that back first.

41:46.128 --> 41:50.591
Also, how did you use the yin-yang jade
to call the Prince?

41:51.592 --> 41:53.802
There's a way. It really does…

41:54.887 --> 41:56.805
make your heart race. [clears throat]

41:56.889 --> 41:58.474
[shudders]

42:00.267 --> 42:01.227
[Jang Uk shivers]

42:02.561 --> 42:03.479
[groans]

42:06.106 --> 42:08.108
[brooding music playing]

42:16.742 --> 42:19.411
[Go Won] Jang Uk, the so-called intruder,
had no sword.

42:20.955 --> 42:23.832
But Jin Mu who claimed to be innocent did.

42:26.502 --> 42:27.711
[sighs]

42:35.052 --> 42:35.970
[maid Kim] Huh?

42:36.679 --> 42:37.513
Young master.

42:38.222 --> 42:41.100
Master Lee, what are you doing
at our house so late?

42:41.183 --> 42:43.227
What are you doing in your house
instead of Songrim?

42:44.478 --> 42:46.063
He's here on probation.

42:47.231 --> 42:50.192
- Oh.
- "Probation"? So you're punished again?

42:50.943 --> 42:52.778
What on earth did you do this time?

42:52.861 --> 42:55.322
No, Maidservant Kim, that's not…

42:55.406 --> 42:57.157
I don't want you to be shocked, okay?

42:57.241 --> 42:58.576
[Jang Uk] It's more like a…

42:59.994 --> 43:01.996
a fake probation. Yes. Uh,

43:02.079 --> 43:04.707
it's more like a reward thing disguised
as a probation, so…

43:04.790 --> 43:05.916
[nervous chuckle]

43:08.460 --> 43:09.837
Yes, that's sort of correct.

43:11.338 --> 43:12.381
[Master Lee] That is good to hear.

43:13.632 --> 43:16.802
Tomorrow, let's go fishing
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

43:18.262 --> 43:19.513
[maid Kim] Good idea.

43:19.597 --> 43:22.683
You should enjoy your time here
and you're really make the most of it

43:22.766 --> 43:24.977
- by relaxing with Young Master Jang.
- [Jang Uk] Goodness.

43:25.060 --> 43:27.688
I can't, Maidservant Kim.
I'm in no position to slack off.

43:28.731 --> 43:30.107
Master Lee, I'm sorry

43:30.190 --> 43:32.735
but you see, I've already lost
nine out of ten duels,

43:32.818 --> 43:34.612
so everything is riding
on the one I have left.

43:34.695 --> 43:37.281
[sucks teeth] I plan to use this time
to focus on training.

43:37.364 --> 43:38.866
I hope you understand my situation.

43:39.366 --> 43:42.411
You've become very diligent
since I saw you last.

43:42.494 --> 43:45.664
Yes, well, if I really want to make
Maidservant Kim proud of me,

43:45.748 --> 43:48.709
then I cannot slack off
by going fishing with you, Master Lee.

43:48.792 --> 43:52.838
You should know, recently, you touch me
with your words every day.

43:53.631 --> 43:54.590
[maid Kim] Very well.

43:54.673 --> 43:56.133
Go ahead and train yourself.

43:56.216 --> 43:59.053
And in the meantime, I'm going to cook
a delicious snack for you.

43:59.136 --> 44:00.429
[Jang Uk breathes deeply]

44:00.512 --> 44:01.639
[maid Kim sobs]

44:01.722 --> 44:03.140
[Jang Uk chuckles]

44:04.683 --> 44:05.684
[Jang Uk] Mm.

44:07.811 --> 44:10.981
Tell me the truth now.
Why are you on probation?

44:11.607 --> 44:12.650
Uh…

44:15.027 --> 44:17.279
I broke the constellation basin
in Cheonbugwan.

44:17.363 --> 44:18.280
[Jang Uk chuckles]

44:18.864 --> 44:20.199
Please do not tell Maidservant Kim.

44:20.282 --> 44:23.243
Earlier, a bolt of lightning
struck above Cheonbugwan.

44:23.327 --> 44:25.579
I suppose that hit
the constellation basin.

44:25.663 --> 44:29.375
We can't tell you anything in detail,
but it wasn't Young Master Jang's fault.

44:30.876 --> 44:33.337
If you go to Songrim,
the leader will tell you everything.

44:35.089 --> 44:36.548
[Jang Uk] I'll lend you a fishing rod.

44:36.632 --> 44:38.467
Back when I used to enjoy fishing,

44:38.550 --> 44:41.136
I would collect all kinds
of different high-quality fishing rods.

44:41.220 --> 44:42.096
I'll get them for you.

44:45.182 --> 44:46.725
[Master Lee] Ugh.

44:47.434 --> 44:48.435
What a pity.

44:50.354 --> 44:54.108
If he came with me, I was going
to teach him how to catch a Golden Fish.

44:55.067 --> 44:56.110
A Golden Fish?

44:56.693 --> 45:00.197
You mean, the legendary golden fish
that can only be found

45:00.280 --> 45:01.865
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

45:02.574 --> 45:03.826
So you also know about the fish?

45:03.909 --> 45:07.121
I've heard of it.
It grows with the lake's energy.

45:07.204 --> 45:11.417
So only mages who have mastered
Chisu or above are able to catch it.

45:11.500 --> 45:14.169
You truly know many things, Mu-deok.

45:14.253 --> 45:16.296
The feeling of catching that fish
as you tussle with it,

45:16.380 --> 45:18.006
the energy of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho…

45:18.090 --> 45:19.466
[inhales deeply]

45:19.550 --> 45:20.759
It's fantastic.

45:22.261 --> 45:25.764
Please, Master Lee, you must teach
Young Master Jang how that feels.

45:25.848 --> 45:26.849
He said he was busy.

45:27.599 --> 45:29.226
[Jang Uk] Master Lee. Master Lee.

45:29.309 --> 45:31.186
Master Lee, take a look at this.

45:31.270 --> 45:33.355
This one is the best one.
It's made with bamboo--

45:33.439 --> 45:35.983
He's not busy. Starting tomorrow,

45:36.066 --> 45:38.944
Young Master Jang
will go fishing with you.

45:41.071 --> 45:42.489
What do you mean? I need to train now.

45:42.573 --> 45:45.868
Jang Uk, right now, you need
a fishing rod, not a sword.

45:47.161 --> 45:50.247
You need to go the lake,
so you can catch a Golden Fish.

45:50.914 --> 45:52.082
Huh?

45:52.166 --> 45:53.625
[epic music]

46:04.636 --> 46:06.221
[Master Lee] This looks like a nice spot.

46:06.722 --> 46:08.140
No, no. No, Master Lee.

46:09.057 --> 46:12.519
I've already tried to fish here before.
The water is too cold.

46:12.603 --> 46:15.355
There's no seaweeds,
so the fish don't swim here.

46:15.898 --> 46:17.649
And we didn't even bring
any of the nice rods.

46:17.733 --> 46:18.901
What's going on right now?

46:18.984 --> 46:22.404
When catching a Golden Fish,
you must use a rod that bends easily.

46:23.405 --> 46:24.490
[Master Lee] Just like this one.

46:26.658 --> 46:28.869
So is that the bait for the Golden Fish?

46:29.453 --> 46:30.621
It's snacks.

46:30.704 --> 46:34.124
Maid Kim packed them for Master Lee.
Just in case he gets hungry.

46:34.833 --> 46:37.753
Maidservant Kim is just such a kind woman.

46:38.337 --> 46:40.255
But, the bait. The bait.
Where's the bait? Come on.

46:40.339 --> 46:42.424
We need worms or mudfish
or something like that.

46:42.508 --> 46:43.634
Wait. What are…

46:44.676 --> 46:47.679
[Jang Uk chuckles]
You're going to fish without bait.

46:47.763 --> 46:51.058
I told you already.
Golden Fish only feed on energy.

46:51.808 --> 46:54.478
[Master Lee] My energy flowing down
through this bamboo stick,

46:55.103 --> 46:56.480
will be all the bait we need.

46:58.649 --> 46:59.608
That's all?

47:00.692 --> 47:03.195
Young Master Jang,
you should do the same as Master Lee.

47:03.278 --> 47:04.279
[Mu-deok grunts]

47:04.363 --> 47:05.656
Go on.

47:05.739 --> 47:06.782
[Jang Uk sighs]

47:12.329 --> 47:16.583
Now, we just need to control
the energy of lake

47:16.667 --> 47:18.669
and wait for a Golden Fish to bite.

47:18.752 --> 47:20.546
[epic music playing]

47:26.176 --> 47:27.094
Mu-deok.

47:27.844 --> 47:30.931
I feel so stupid doing this.
Do I really have to continue?

47:32.266 --> 47:33.350
[Jang Uk sighs]

47:38.564 --> 47:39.523
Look, it's biting the hook.

47:50.659 --> 47:52.369
And that's the Golden Fish.

47:53.036 --> 47:56.498
[Master Lee] It's a lump of water made
from the energy of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

47:57.332 --> 48:00.586
That's why only those
who've mastered Chisu can catch it

48:00.669 --> 48:02.337
because they can control
the water's energy.

48:04.548 --> 48:06.466
I haven't been fishing for a while.

48:06.550 --> 48:09.845
But I must say, it still feels great
to be able to catch a Golden Fish.

48:12.139 --> 48:14.683
So the Golden Fish is not an actual fish
I guess.

48:15.267 --> 48:17.561
Master Lee didn't bring you here to fish.

48:18.270 --> 48:21.315
He's here to help you
reach the level of Chisu.

48:22.441 --> 48:26.069
[Mu-deok] Only those who can catch lumps
of energy out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho…

48:27.613 --> 48:29.364
are able to master Chisu.

48:31.158 --> 48:32.451
"Chisu"?

48:40.709 --> 48:44.171
- Go slowly.
- [stammers] Slowly.

48:44.254 --> 48:47.090
You're too hurried. Go slowly.

48:47.966 --> 48:49.468
Slowly.

48:53.263 --> 48:55.515
[ominous music playing]

49:02.522 --> 49:04.733
Cheonbugwan must have found
another blind lady.

49:04.816 --> 49:07.235
Young Lady Jin says they bring in several

49:07.319 --> 49:09.196
from all over the country
every single day.

49:11.782 --> 49:13.659
- Let's go in.
- Okay.

49:26.088 --> 49:28.131
[Ho-gyeong] So you are saying that

49:28.215 --> 49:31.218
there could be a soul shifter
hidden within every family

49:31.301 --> 49:33.220
that lost someone to Naksu,

49:33.303 --> 49:35.514
and you want to use Jinyowon's relics

49:36.348 --> 49:37.516
to find all of them?

49:37.599 --> 49:42.145
We were waiting for the soul shifter
who ran wild at Daegangtongun to tell us,

49:42.229 --> 49:44.189
but we cannot just keep waiting.

49:44.272 --> 49:45.482
Because last night,

49:46.608 --> 49:48.777
we found another soul shifter.

49:50.028 --> 49:50.946
Yes, I heard.

49:51.446 --> 49:55.033
There was a eunuch at Cheonbugwan
who was a soul shifter.

49:55.117 --> 49:58.412
Jin Mu must have already visited Jinyowon.

49:59.371 --> 50:03.875
My brother, Jin Mu, told me Songrim
sent someone to Cheonbugwan

50:04.501 --> 50:07.754
and hurled false accusations at him.
He's very upset.

50:07.838 --> 50:10.966
To clear his name, we'll find out
if he's using sorcery,

50:11.591 --> 50:15.679
we need Jinyowon's relics
and the power of its leader.

50:15.762 --> 50:16.972
Please help me.

50:18.890 --> 50:19.933
I am sorry but…

50:21.435 --> 50:22.811
I may have to refuse.

50:24.813 --> 50:28.567
It is the utmost disgrace for a mage
to be accused of sorcery.

50:29.401 --> 50:30.861
If we start going around

50:30.944 --> 50:35.198
investigating mages without any evidence,
it will anger many people.

50:36.158 --> 50:38.910
They will begin to resent Jinyowon.

50:38.994 --> 50:40.328
I heard Jin Mu…

50:41.204 --> 50:43.915
has been searching
for your eldest daughter who's missing.

50:44.833 --> 50:48.170
Did he ask you
not to cooperate with Songrim

50:48.670 --> 50:50.922
in return for helping you
find your eldest daughter?

50:51.506 --> 50:53.383
- That's completely irrelevant.
- [Jin] No, it is not.

50:53.467 --> 50:57.971
Your attitude toward Songrim has suddenly
changed lately for no apparent reason.

50:58.054 --> 51:01.516
And are you expecting me
without questioning to just comply

51:01.600 --> 51:02.976
with whatever you command?

51:04.394 --> 51:08.315
The people of Jinyowon
are not merely loyal minions to Songrim,

51:08.398 --> 51:09.900
who follow every order you give.

51:09.983 --> 51:11.818
- Lady Jin--
- Please leave my home.

51:12.903 --> 51:15.697
[Ho-gyeong] There is someone else
I must meet with now.

51:16.990 --> 51:19.785
[tense music playing]

51:26.291 --> 51:29.252
Once they find your older sister,

51:29.336 --> 51:32.756
then there will be no other obstacles
that could possibly come between us.

51:32.839 --> 51:36.176
That's because Songrim and Jinyowon
are close to each other.

51:36.259 --> 51:38.011
Uh, also…

51:40.597 --> 51:41.723
- here.
- [gasps]

51:43.225 --> 51:45.811
This is the ornament
that I said was pretty last time.

51:46.478 --> 51:48.772
They said someone have reserved it,
so I couldn't buy it.

51:48.855 --> 51:50.440
How did you get it though?

51:50.524 --> 51:53.610
I paid that person
a lot more than its original price.

51:53.693 --> 51:55.403
Because I thought you would like it.

51:55.487 --> 51:57.572
That makes me even more happy then.

51:57.656 --> 52:01.243
[gasps] Uh, the fact that you are happy
makes me even more

52:01.326 --> 52:05.038
more, more, more, more,
more, more, more, more happy than that.

52:05.997 --> 52:08.792
- You!
- [gasps, laughs]

52:08.875 --> 52:11.294
- [Cho-yeon giggles]
- [groans]

52:16.132 --> 52:17.551
Why does my uncle look so upset?

52:18.134 --> 52:19.469
Has something terrible happened?

52:20.512 --> 52:23.139
I think he had an argument
with Jinyowon's leader.

52:26.560 --> 52:28.562
[melancholy music playing]

52:42.951 --> 52:45.287
I drew a red mole
behind her left ear, sir.

52:47.080 --> 52:51.251
Bu-yeon also has a scar on her right arm
from when she fell as a child.

52:53.587 --> 52:56.047
It is approximately
a third of a finger length long.

53:00.385 --> 53:02.512
[ominous music playing]

53:14.107 --> 53:15.859
[groans]

53:16.735 --> 53:18.945
[breathing heavily]

53:20.572 --> 53:23.033
[ominous music continues playing]

53:28.413 --> 53:30.123
This is how you become Jin Bu-yeon.

53:30.624 --> 53:31.666
Endure it.

53:32.667 --> 53:34.502
From the smallest mole to the last scar,

53:34.586 --> 53:37.756
we'll engrave every tiny detail
that her mother remembers.

53:39.674 --> 53:40.759
Yes.

53:40.842 --> 53:44.387
I will pour acid on your skin
so that the scar is clearer.

53:48.892 --> 53:51.019
[gasps, panting]

53:58.026 --> 53:59.444
[groans]

54:15.835 --> 54:18.755
[water sloshing]

54:26.471 --> 54:27.514
[sighs]

54:28.098 --> 54:31.518
What kind of fish is Young Master Jang
trying to catch

54:31.601 --> 54:33.353
that he needs to spend
so much time at that lake?

54:33.937 --> 54:36.481
I should probably go
and bring them some food.

54:36.564 --> 54:38.566
[maid Kim] I'll ask Mr. Lee to do that.

54:38.650 --> 54:40.777
I want you here
to help me out with something else.

54:42.612 --> 54:44.406
We're holding memorial service,

54:44.489 --> 54:46.533
so we must clean the house
and prepare plenty of food.

54:48.034 --> 54:49.285
Whose memorial?

54:49.369 --> 54:51.413
A young girl who died a pitiful death.

54:52.080 --> 54:54.332
She had a difficult relationship
with our family,

54:54.416 --> 54:56.418
so I'm holding a ceremony
to soothe her soul.

54:57.961 --> 54:59.295
[Mr. Lee] Maidservant Kim.

54:59.379 --> 55:00.880
I'm back from the temple.

55:00.964 --> 55:02.132
- [maid Kim] All right.
- Here is

55:02.215 --> 55:04.551
- the oration the Buddhist monk wrote.
- [maid Kim] Oh.

55:05.885 --> 55:07.595
Oh, goodness, this is great.

55:08.680 --> 55:10.306
[maid Kim] But where are their names?

55:10.390 --> 55:12.559
He should have written down the names
of the spirits this is for.

55:12.642 --> 55:13.935
[Mr. Lee] Oh, no.

55:14.019 --> 55:16.813
Oh, they're right down there.
"Cho Chung, Cho Yeong."

55:18.148 --> 55:20.191
[Mu-deok] Cho Yeong? That's my name.

55:20.942 --> 55:22.944
[maid Kim] Oh, yes. I see it now.

55:23.028 --> 55:24.571
"Cho Chung, Cho Yeong."

55:25.196 --> 55:27.323
[maid Kim sighs relievedly]
He wrote it wonderfully.

55:27.407 --> 55:29.784
Mr. Lee, please come with me.

55:30.326 --> 55:31.911
I need you to deliver food
to Young Master Jang.

55:31.995 --> 55:33.163
[Mr. Lee] Yes, ma'am.

55:34.622 --> 55:36.499
[Mu-deok] Is this memorial service…

55:37.542 --> 55:39.210
for me and my father?

56:11.326 --> 56:12.494
[huffs]

56:18.166 --> 56:20.043
Mushroom rice, my favorite.

56:20.627 --> 56:23.880
Maidservant Kim really is a great cook.

56:25.840 --> 56:27.801
[tense music playing]

56:31.096 --> 56:32.514
It bit! I got one!

56:33.014 --> 56:33.973
[grunts]

56:35.183 --> 56:36.226
[music distorts]

56:37.227 --> 56:39.312
[quirky music playing]

56:43.024 --> 56:45.485
This one was caught by the worm
I put on the hook earlier.

56:46.653 --> 56:48.071
It'll be a good side dish.

56:53.785 --> 56:55.161
Oh, gosh.

57:13.012 --> 57:14.013
Mm.

57:19.936 --> 57:21.479
Do not rush yourself.

57:23.231 --> 57:25.817
One day, you'll have the same feeling
that you get

57:25.900 --> 57:28.278
when a Golden Fish
finally latches onto your hook.

57:28.361 --> 57:31.948
The power to control the water's energy,
Chisu.

57:33.658 --> 57:34.659
Yes.

57:35.743 --> 57:38.830
But Master Lee, you already helped me
read Words of the Heart.

57:39.414 --> 57:41.708
May I ask the reason
why you keep trying to help me?

57:42.959 --> 57:45.837
Is there any chance,
the reason you're doing this

57:46.337 --> 57:49.382
is a secret or something?

57:51.301 --> 57:52.760
Something you don't know.

57:52.844 --> 57:54.512
Do you really think I don't know?

57:57.056 --> 57:58.516
It's my family.

58:03.521 --> 58:05.106
It's Maidservant Kim. Am I wrong?

58:07.025 --> 58:10.320
I mean, you compliment her nonstop
and you're always talking about her.

58:10.403 --> 58:12.739
Huh. And that pink scarf you're wearing.

58:12.822 --> 58:15.116
I can tell that it's from
Maidservant Kim's favorite shop.

58:16.159 --> 58:17.368
She gave you that scarf, right?

58:18.411 --> 58:19.621
And most importantly,

58:19.704 --> 58:23.416
I saw the dried wildflowers
in Maidservant Kim's room.

58:23.500 --> 58:25.752
And I saw them everywhere at Danhyanggok.

58:25.835 --> 58:27.795
You picked them and gave them to her,
didn't you?

58:28.963 --> 58:31.591
- Yes, I did.
- Ah. I knew it.

58:32.926 --> 58:34.969
But I thought you practiced chastity…

58:35.053 --> 58:35.887
I'm not--

58:35.970 --> 58:38.306
[stammers]
My feelings for her are not worldly.

58:38.890 --> 58:41.518
I just think that she is beautiful
and warm-hearted.

58:41.601 --> 58:43.019
That's all there is to it.

58:43.561 --> 58:46.105
That's the same thing
as just saying that you like her.

58:46.189 --> 58:48.733
And anyway, what between a man
and woman isn't profane.

58:49.317 --> 58:50.193
What about you?

58:50.860 --> 58:53.905
You're a man and Mu-deok is a woman.
What does that make you two?

58:55.907 --> 58:57.492
Well, as for me…

58:59.118 --> 59:00.161
I do like her.

59:03.998 --> 59:05.166
[Jang Uk chuckles softly]

59:05.750 --> 59:08.711
I can't believe I'm talking about this
with a man who practices chastity.

59:08.795 --> 59:12.257
Anyways, Maidservant Kim has had feelings
for someone else for a while.

59:12.340 --> 59:13.716
I hope you don't end up getting hurt.

59:13.800 --> 59:15.385
I should be the one saying that to you.

59:16.219 --> 59:18.846
I heard that Mu-deok likes Yul.

59:18.930 --> 59:21.516
Did you hear that from Dang-gu?
What a profane topic, huh?

59:21.599 --> 59:23.518
You're not the only one I spend time with.

59:24.269 --> 59:25.562
[Jang Uk sighs]

59:25.645 --> 59:26.896
Worldly discussions can…

59:28.147 --> 59:30.024
can sometimes be helpful.

59:32.151 --> 59:34.237
From Yul's story about his first love,

59:34.320 --> 59:37.240
I was able to learn about Naksu,
the shadow assassin.

59:37.323 --> 59:39.325
[pensive music playing]

59:40.243 --> 59:43.246
The girl he described meeting
at Danhyanggok when he was young…

59:44.330 --> 59:45.707
was really Naksu.

59:46.833 --> 59:50.962
He knew it was her when he saw his whistle
on her dead body.

59:53.298 --> 59:57.343
I know that you overheard my conversation
with Jin at Sejukwon.

01:00:00.096 --> 01:00:02.724
So I'm guessing that you already know
the story of Naksu.

01:00:06.519 --> 01:00:08.146
You should go home early today.

01:00:09.355 --> 01:00:10.940
Warm-hearted Maidservant Kim

01:00:11.733 --> 01:00:15.111
is holding a memorial service
for a child who died a pitiful death.

01:00:26.247 --> 01:00:28.082
[men grunting]

01:00:31.586 --> 01:00:32.962
[man] That will do just fine.

01:00:33.046 --> 01:00:34.881
The constellation basin is fixed.

01:00:34.964 --> 01:00:37.925
So you can take your laborers
and return back to Songrim.

01:00:38.009 --> 01:00:41.137
Mm-mmm. We can't leave
before it's perfect.

01:00:41.220 --> 01:00:42.680
[man] Cheonbugwan thinks it's good enough.

01:00:42.764 --> 01:00:44.015
What do you want this time?

01:00:44.098 --> 01:00:45.475
Hey. Hey, do you see that?

01:00:45.558 --> 01:00:49.354
The lower part of the basin
is a different color from the top part.

01:00:49.937 --> 01:00:51.981
We should change the lower part as well.

01:00:52.065 --> 01:00:54.108
You've changed it dozens of times already.

01:00:54.609 --> 01:00:55.943
I'm telling you, it's fine.

01:00:56.027 --> 01:00:57.445
Songrim's leader promised

01:00:57.528 --> 01:01:00.406
to take responsibility and return
the basin to its original state.

01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:02.784
We can't let a single flaw slide.

01:01:04.285 --> 01:01:06.913
Construction usually takes
a day or two at most.

01:01:07.580 --> 01:01:09.207
But this is taking a bit.

01:01:09.290 --> 01:01:11.668
It seems that you feel pretty uneasy
about having us here.

01:01:11.751 --> 01:01:12.960
Uneasy about what?

01:01:13.753 --> 01:01:17.298
It just seems to me that Songrim
is wasting quite a bit of everyone's time.

01:01:17.382 --> 01:01:19.717
And also their money.
[chuckles]

01:01:22.220 --> 01:01:25.431
You don't have to worry about money
when it comes to Songrim.

01:01:26.057 --> 01:01:27.058
[scoffs]

01:01:27.684 --> 01:01:30.395
[Jin Mu] Yul, the last time I saw you,
you seemed quite skilled.

01:01:30.478 --> 01:01:32.146
Have you mastered Chisu?

01:01:34.107 --> 01:01:35.566
- Yes.
- [Jin Mu] Hmm.

01:01:36.150 --> 01:01:39.195
Then that must make you
the very first mage in Jeongjingak

01:01:39.278 --> 01:01:40.655
to have mastered Chisu.

01:01:41.280 --> 01:01:44.409
[Jin Mu] How fitting for the son
of General Seo of Seoho Fortress.

01:01:45.326 --> 01:01:47.370
So he's a Jeongjingak mage.

01:01:48.746 --> 01:01:50.790
[Seo Yul] You cannot drag people off
against their will.

01:01:50.873 --> 01:01:52.166
[man grunts]

01:01:52.250 --> 01:01:53.418
[gasps]

01:01:56.254 --> 01:01:57.922
Are you able to stand?

01:02:00.341 --> 01:02:01.300
[Yeom-su] What are you looking at?

01:02:04.554 --> 01:02:06.639
[So-i] Is he a Jeongjingak mage?

01:02:06.723 --> 01:02:09.183
- Is his name Seo Yul?
- [Yeom-su] Yes.

01:02:09.267 --> 01:02:12.520
And they're sons of prestigious families
which means they're out of your league.

01:02:12.603 --> 01:02:14.439
Don't wander around and stay hidden.

01:02:20.903 --> 01:02:23.781
He may be out of my league
as So-i, a wandering thief.

01:02:27.034 --> 01:02:29.579
But as Jin Bu-yeon,
future leader of Jinyowon…

01:02:31.622 --> 01:02:33.124
I still might have a chance.

01:02:41.924 --> 01:02:44.635
[maid Kim] It is for Master Jang's friend
and his daughter.

01:02:46.971 --> 01:02:48.723
There are no graves for either of them,

01:02:49.724 --> 01:02:52.226
and I bet no one's ever held
a memorial for them.

01:02:52.977 --> 01:02:54.812
So I thought I should hold at least one.

01:02:56.731 --> 01:02:57.857
Maidservant Kim.

01:02:58.983 --> 01:03:00.067
[maid Kim] Hmm?

01:03:00.735 --> 01:03:01.986
Thank you for this.

01:03:03.029 --> 01:03:04.322
Hmm?

01:03:06.449 --> 01:03:07.867
That's what they would say.

01:03:08.993 --> 01:03:11.412
I imagine they are truly grateful.

01:03:11.496 --> 01:03:12.580
[chuckles softly]

01:03:13.122 --> 01:03:14.791
It's a relief for me to hear that.

01:03:16.417 --> 01:03:18.753
Leave the incense sticks
till they burn out.

01:03:19.712 --> 01:03:22.215
[melancholy music playing]

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:48.908
CHO CHUNG, CHO YEONG

01:04:05.508 --> 01:04:09.470
CHO CHUNG, CHO YEONG

01:04:15.726 --> 01:04:17.520
[sobbing]

01:04:17.603 --> 01:04:18.813
Father…

01:04:31.158 --> 01:04:32.660
Young Master Jang went fishing.

01:04:33.369 --> 01:04:36.080
He'll be back shortly, so you can wait
for him inside if you'd like.

01:04:37.582 --> 01:04:39.417
Did Mu-deok also go together with him?

01:04:39.500 --> 01:04:41.335
Mu-deok is here at home

01:04:41.419 --> 01:04:43.337
because she was busy preparing
for a memorial.

01:04:52.179 --> 01:04:53.180
[Mu-deoks sniffles]

01:04:57.810 --> 01:05:00.229
CHO CHUNG, CHO YEONG

01:05:02.815 --> 01:05:04.150
[Seo Yul] If I had not…

01:05:05.484 --> 01:05:07.820
left you there in the mountains back then,

01:05:10.698 --> 01:05:14.911
you wouldn't be suffering like this,
holding back your tears

01:05:15.870 --> 01:05:18.247
and pretending to be someone else.

01:05:23.586 --> 01:05:25.171
And yet, even now,

01:05:27.173 --> 01:05:29.175
I can't seem to tell you that…

01:05:30.593 --> 01:05:32.637
I know who you really are.

01:05:32.720 --> 01:05:34.263
[breathes shakily]

01:05:45.691 --> 01:05:47.318
CHO CHUNG, CHO YEONG

01:05:51.864 --> 01:05:52.782
[maid Kim] Oh.

01:05:53.407 --> 01:05:54.659
The incense burned out.

01:05:56.285 --> 01:05:57.328
Yes.

01:05:57.995 --> 01:05:59.038
It did.

01:05:59.622 --> 01:06:01.248
You've been here this whole time?

01:06:04.043 --> 01:06:05.044
Let's clean up.

01:06:06.837 --> 01:06:08.005
[maid Kim sighs]

01:06:14.971 --> 01:06:17.139
[flame crackling]

01:06:18.099 --> 01:06:20.601
[dramatic music playing]

01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.248
[Jang Uk sighs]

01:06:45.292 --> 01:06:48.212
You're back. I heard you went fishing.

01:06:48.295 --> 01:06:50.339
Yeah, I just got back.

01:06:50.423 --> 01:06:51.757
You're alone? Where's Dang-gu?

01:06:51.841 --> 01:06:54.593
Dang-gu is busy with something else.
I think meeting someone.

01:06:54.677 --> 01:06:55.928
Mm, I see.

01:06:57.179 --> 01:06:58.431
What brings you here though?

01:06:58.514 --> 01:07:01.517
The leader has ended your probation.
He wants you to come back to Songrim.

01:07:02.101 --> 01:07:04.520
Hmm. That was faster than I expected.

01:07:05.479 --> 01:07:08.691
Why don't you sit down? We'll have
some drinks. I need to talk to you.

01:07:08.774 --> 01:07:10.401
Sorry, I can't drink right now.

01:07:11.152 --> 01:07:12.945
There's something I have to do
back in Songrim.

01:07:13.029 --> 01:07:16.907
All right. Then I'll tell you tomorrow
at Jeongjingak.

01:07:17.408 --> 01:07:19.160
You're definitely going
to be surprised by it.

01:07:20.828 --> 01:07:24.415
Uk, I'll be returning back
to Seoho Fortress soon.

01:07:26.167 --> 01:07:28.044
I promised my father that

01:07:28.127 --> 01:07:30.713
I would train at Jeongjingak
until I mastered Chisu.

01:07:31.422 --> 01:07:33.883
Master Heo has already written
to my father,

01:07:33.966 --> 01:07:35.843
so he might write for me to return soon.

01:07:36.427 --> 01:07:37.511
Then I'll have to go.

01:07:37.595 --> 01:07:39.180
But that's so far away.

01:07:40.056 --> 01:07:42.975
Ugh. Dang-gu and I
are going to miss you so much.

01:07:44.643 --> 01:07:46.437
When I go back to Seoho Fortress,

01:07:48.022 --> 01:07:49.857
there's someone I'd like to bring with me.

01:07:49.940 --> 01:07:51.942
[pensive music playing]

01:07:52.568 --> 01:07:54.695
- Who?
- I can't say now.

01:07:56.655 --> 01:07:57.907
I will tell you soon.

01:08:00.159 --> 01:08:01.869
I should get back. See you tomorrow.

01:08:02.995 --> 01:08:04.080
All right. Bye.

01:08:07.374 --> 01:08:10.002
["Love Letter (with you)"
by BIG Naughty playing]

01:08:38.364 --> 01:08:39.782
[Seo Yul] I just wanted to see them.

01:08:39.865 --> 01:08:41.951
I just like seeing them a lot.

01:08:42.034 --> 01:08:45.121
["Love Letter (with you)"
continues playing]

01:08:45.746 --> 01:08:48.749
They can prevent the petrification
by feeding on others' energy.

01:08:48.833 --> 01:08:50.126
But once they do that, they are…

01:08:51.210 --> 01:08:52.795
 no longer human, but a monster.

01:08:54.004 --> 01:08:56.799
Protecting this world from such monsters

01:08:56.882 --> 01:08:58.217
is our duty.

01:09:01.262 --> 01:09:04.431
[Jang Uk]
I wonder if Yul knows everything.

01:09:05.724 --> 01:09:07.560
[Seo Yul]
When I go back to Seoho Fortress,

01:09:08.144 --> 01:09:09.854
there's someone I'd like to bring with me.

01:09:16.277 --> 01:09:17.278
[Mu-deok] Young master.

01:09:17.987 --> 01:09:19.113
Oh?

01:09:22.158 --> 01:09:25.035
Did Seo Yul leave?
Maidservant Kim sent me with these.

01:09:32.626 --> 01:09:33.836
I think he meant you.

01:09:35.004 --> 01:09:37.673
What? Yul said something?

01:09:41.218 --> 01:09:42.720
I'm returning to Songrim.

01:09:43.721 --> 01:09:45.055
So that's why you look upset.

01:09:45.848 --> 01:09:47.933
As soon as you return, Beom will ask you

01:09:48.475 --> 01:09:50.269
to fight for him for your last duel.

01:09:51.020 --> 01:09:52.146
You're afraid to lose.

01:09:52.229 --> 01:09:54.690
[inhales] I will not lose.

01:09:54.773 --> 01:09:56.734
[epic music playing]

01:09:57.276 --> 01:09:58.485
I finally caught it.

01:10:17.838 --> 01:10:20.007
Today is Jang Uk's final duel.

01:10:21.592 --> 01:10:22.676
[exhale deeply]

01:10:23.177 --> 01:10:25.429
[Go Won] The bettor and I have agreed,

01:10:25.512 --> 01:10:27.264
the prize for today's winner

01:10:28.098 --> 01:10:30.392
will not be a gold toad
but instead, something else.

01:10:44.823 --> 01:10:46.367
The prize for today's duel…

01:10:47.785 --> 01:10:49.078
is this servant.

01:10:49.161 --> 01:10:50.704
- [man] What?
- [crowd murmuring]

01:10:54.708 --> 01:10:57.086
- [scoffs]
- I have agreed to serve…

01:10:59.004 --> 01:11:01.215
the winner of today's duel as my master.

01:11:11.225 --> 01:11:13.018
- What's going on?
- [Go Won] All right, then.

01:11:13.686 --> 01:11:15.312
Jang Uk's final challenger,

01:11:16.063 --> 01:11:17.022
step forward.

01:11:21.735 --> 01:11:22.611
[scoffs]

01:11:32.705 --> 01:11:35.708
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the garden playing]

01:11:45.467 --> 01:11:46.385
Jang Uk.

01:11:48.304 --> 01:11:50.639
The person you have to fight against today

01:11:51.307 --> 01:11:52.599
will be me.

01:12:46.820 --> 01:12:51.992
[Jin] Uk was born with a fate that
could bring about chaos in this world.

01:12:52.076 --> 01:12:54.286
And he draws the full attention
of the entire world.

01:12:54.370 --> 01:12:56.205
I need someone who will win for sure.

01:12:56.288 --> 01:12:58.791
[Seo Yul] Then I have to beat Uk
and take her in as my servant.

01:12:58.874 --> 01:13:02.753
[Go Won] Has he somehow mastered all
of his opponents' spells and techniques?

01:13:02.836 --> 01:13:05.005
- [Mu-deok] I need to find it.
- [Go Won] You should also lose something.

01:13:05.089 --> 01:13:07.091
Your heart-wrenching love
will be thrown away.

01:13:07.174 --> 01:13:10.010
[Mu-deok]
Only after will I be able to face Uk.

01:13:10.094 --> 01:13:11.595
[Jin] Talk to everyone
that you can find there.

01:13:11.678 --> 01:13:13.847
Find out exactly who she is.

01:13:13.931 --> 01:13:16.100
[Mu-deok] "Eyes brimming with sweetness,"
yeah, right.

01:13:16.183 --> 01:13:17.351
You don't see me as a woman.

01:13:17.434 --> 01:13:19.103
I'll do it. So don't go
changing your mind later.

01:13:19.186 --> 01:13:20.562
All right, go ahead.

01:13:21.146 --> 01:13:24.817
[Mu-deok] The truth is that I like
my young master a lot.
